  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Chen Cui Hua is locked in a draining fight with a twin-headed boar while Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing watch from cover. Fang Yuan notes how long she lasts and guesses she has some support Gu such as heavenly essence treasure lotus, or Fish Bubble Gu, and similar worms. After they kill her, the aperture loot shows no Gu that recovers primeval essence, so that guess stays unconfirmed for the fight.",
